==Trivia==
* The layout of the Spring of Power strongly resembles that of the [[Earth Spring]] in {{SS}}, being located around the same [[Eldin Volcano|region]] and featuring identical geometry, waterfalls and architecture. However, the positioning of the Trees resemble the [[Skyview Spring]], which is located deeper in the [[Faron Woods]].

==Nomenclature==
The Spring of Power is named for the [[Triforce of Power]].<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 351}}</ref>
